// mbel — MoonBit Expression Language
// ast package: AST node types for parsed expressions
//
// Ported from Jexl's AST node shapes produced by the Parser.
// The Parser builds trees incrementally (placeAtCursor, placeBeforeCursor),
// so AstNode uses mutable fields to allow in-place modification.
